# script-ch4.rpyc:8
translate chinese ch4_main_7f03563e:

    # "It's already Sunday."
    "转眼已经是周日了。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:10
translate chinese ch4_main_e8881ae0:

    # "I've been getting increasingly anxious about Natsuki's upcoming visit."
    "夏树即将到访，我的心越来越不安。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:11
translate chinese ch4_main_1e3fd2be:

    # "I keep telling myself there's no reason to be nervous, but it doesn't help much."
    "我不断告诉自己没什么好紧张的，可完全没用。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:12
translate chinese ch4_main_d63e1a44:

    # "I wonder if she'll act any different when it's just the two of us?"
    "只有我们两个人独处时，她会不会变得不一样呢？"

# script-ch4.rpyc:13
translate chinese ch4_main_c1d95768:

    # "Meanwhile, she's been texting me a lot."
    "与此同时，她一直在给我发消息。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:14
translate chinese ch4_main_a36be6d2:

    # "We sent each other one after exchanging numbers to double-check, but it turned into conversation."
    "交换号码后我们互相发了一条确认，结果不知不觉就聊了起来。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:15
translate chinese ch4_main_4ac86efe:

    # "She's almost a different personality on the phone, using tons of emoji and cute language."
    "手机上的她简直判若两人，满屏的表情包和软萌的语气。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:16
translate chinese ch4_main_51122e85:

    # "She also really likes complaining about things, but I kind of saw that one coming."
    "她还特别喜欢吐槽，这一点我倒是早有预料。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:17
translate chinese ch4_main_54fc51cb:

    # "But putting Natsuki aside..."
    "不过夏树的事先放到一边……"

# script-ch4.rpyc:19
translate chinese ch4_main_533ca6d9:

    # "I've been getting increasingly anxious about Yuri's upcoming visit."
    "优里即将到访，我的心越来越不安。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:20
translate chinese ch4_main_1e3fd2be_1:

    # "I keep telling myself there's no reason to be nervous, but it doesn't help much."
    "我不断告诉自己没什么好紧张的，可完全没用。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:21
translate chinese ch4_main_6a261072:

    # "Yuri is clearly an introvert and also an intimate person in general."
    "优里显然是个内向、也很注重私人空间的人。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:22
translate chinese ch4_main_172e5fe9:

    # "There's no doubt that she'll open up a little bit when it's just the two of us."
    "只有我们两个人独处时，她肯定会更放得开一些。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:23
translate chinese ch4_main_dcb4a9fe:

    # "Meanwhile, we've even been texting occasionally."
    "与此同时，我们偶尔也会互发消息。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:24
translate chinese ch4_main_c1a6e593:

    # "She was extremely apprehensive at first, but it wasn't long before I was already learning more about her."
    "起初她顾虑重重，但没过多久，我便开始越来越了解她。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:25
translate chinese ch4_main_3adbf0d5:

    # "But putting Yuri aside..."
    "不过优里的事先放到一边……"

# script-ch4.rpyc:26
translate chinese ch4_main_e9699a3e:

    # "I haven't heard a thing from Sayori since she left club early the other day."
    "自从那天提前离开社团后，纱世里就音讯全无。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:27
translate chinese ch4_main_25706431:

    # "It's not like we text each other all the time or anything..."
    "虽然我们平时也不是总互相发消息……"

# script-ch4.rpyc:28
translate chinese ch4_main_8e3af5cc:

    # "But I've been worried about her in the back of my mind."
    "但我心里始终惦记着她。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:29
translate chinese ch4_main_77697156:

    # "Between what Sayori said, and what Monika said..."
    "纱世里说的那些话，还有莫妮卡说的那些……"

# script-ch4.rpyc:30
translate chinese ch4_main_be038b9e:

    # "Is it really okay for me to put Sayori's feelings aside when she might need me?"
    "在她可能正需要我的时候，把纱世里的感受抛在一边，真的好吗？"

# script-ch4.rpyc:35
translate chinese ch4_main_29ce83ba:

    # "I decide to visit Sayori before [ch4_name] comes over."
    "[ch4_name]到来之前，我决定先去看看纱世里。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:36
translate chinese ch4_main_f5e89c18:

    # "Rather than asking, I simply tell her \"I'm coming over\", much like we've done in the past."
    "我没有询问，只是像从前那样，直接告诉她“我过去了”。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:37
translate chinese ch4_main_b6b01504:

    # "Once I reach Sayori's house, I knock on the door before entering it myself."
    "到了纱世里家，我敲了敲门，便自己推门进去。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:38
translate chinese ch4_main_f3cf9c85:

    # "Again, we used to play so often that we've made it a habit of simply entering each other's houses like we were family."
    "毕竟我们从小一起玩到大，早已习惯了像家人一样径直进出彼此的家门。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:40
translate chinese ch4_main_d02cb356:

    # "The house is quiet."
    "屋子里静悄悄的。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:41
translate chinese ch4_main_ba76d2b3:

    # "Sayori isn't anywhere on the first floor, so I assume she's up in her room."
    "一楼不见纱世里的身影，她应该在自己房间里。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:42
translate chinese ch4_main_122612c2:

    # "It's already strange of her not to run down and greet me."
    "她居然没有飞奔下楼迎接我，这本身就不寻常。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:43
translate chinese ch4_main_cfd27d7b:

    # "I head up to her bedroom, where I finally find her."
    "我上楼走进她的卧室，终于找到了她。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:45
translate chinese ch4_main_e766b9e2:

    # mc "Sayori?"
    mc "纱世里？"

# script-ch4.rpyc:48
translate chinese ch4_main_168027c8:

    # s "Hi [player]~"
    s "嗨，[player]~"

# script-ch4.rpyc:50
translate chinese ch4_main_d5c40262:

    # "I sit down in her room."
    "我在她房间里坐下。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:51
translate chinese ch4_main_cde4b14b:

    # "Sayori forces a smile, but it's easy to tell that she's different."
    "纱世里挤出一个笑容，可一眼就能看出她的不对劲。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:52
translate chinese ch4_main_60097b82:

    # "There's a minute of silence between us."
    "我们之间沉默了足足一分钟。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:53
translate chinese ch4_main_91dd180c:

    # s "You haven't come over like this in a long time, have you?"
    "你好久没这样来我房间了呢。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:54
translate chinese ch4_main_39957f69:

    # mc "Ah... I guess you're right."
    mc "啊……确实。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:55
translate chinese ch4_main_bbd67548:

    # mc "It has been a long time."
    mc "好久没来了。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:56
translate chinese ch4_main_9f9c925d:

    # mc "Not much has really changed, has it?"
    mc "这里倒是一点都没变呢。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:57
translate chinese ch4_main_3e8f239e:

    # "Sayori's room is as messy as it's always been."
    "纱世里的房间还是一如既往地乱。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:58
translate chinese ch4_main_aebaa3fb:

    # "I also recognize the same stuffed animals and wall decorations that she's had for years now."
    "那些毛绒玩具和墙上的装饰，也都是陪伴了她好几年的老面孔。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:59
translate chinese ch4_main_506cc7c0:

    # s 2bl "Ehehe~"
    s 2bl "诶嘿嘿~"

# script-ch4.rpyc:60
translate chinese ch4_main_a8c5f7d4:

    # s "If you came over more often, it wouldn't be such a mess."
    s "你要是常来，它就不会乱成这样啦。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:61
translate chinese ch4_main_7d0484ac:

    # mc "That's because I end up cleaning it for you..."
    mc "那是因为最后都是我帮你收拾……"

# script-ch4.rpyc:62
translate chinese ch4_main_c067efa9:

    # s 1bb "How come you suddenly wanted to come over today?"
    s 1bb "今天怎么突然想过来了？"

# script-ch4.rpyc:63
translate chinese ch4_main_9e1f01a3:

    # s "Aren't you supposed to see [ch4_name] today?"
    s "你不是今天要和[ch4_name]见面吗？"

# script-ch4.rpyc:64
translate chinese ch4_main_3f1ca1d2:

    # mc "Yeah, but..."
    mc "嗯，可是……"

# script-ch4.rpyc:65
translate chinese ch4_main_5f378027:

    # mc "...Wait, how did you know that?"
    mc "……等等，你怎么知道的？"

# script-ch4.rpyc:66
translate chinese ch4_main_be7d338c:

    # "Sayori had already left by the time we decided that last meeting."
    "上次定下这件事的时候，纱世里早就回家了。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:67
translate chinese ch4_main_aad7ca62:

    # s 1ba "Monika told me."
    s 1ba "莫妮卡告诉我的。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:68
translate chinese ch4_main_c3ad1529:

    # s "It's only natural for her to keep me informed about the festival preparations, right?"
    s "学园祭的准备情况她都会跟我同步，这很正常嘛。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:69
translate chinese ch4_main_29886549:

    # mc "Ah, that's true..."
    mc "啊，也是……"

# script-ch4.rpyc:70
translate chinese ch4_main_0e65e446:

    # mc "But what about you?"
    mc "那你呢？"

# script-ch4.rpyc:71
translate chinese ch4_main_230aada7:

    # mc "Aren't you going to be helping Monika today?"
    mc "你今天不去帮莫妮卡吗？"

# script-ch4.rpyc:72
translate chinese ch4_main_8bbf088c:

    # s 4bb "Of course!"
    s 4bb "当然要帮！"

# script-ch4.rpyc:73
translate chinese ch4_main_ce469512:

    # s "But I'm just helping her online."
    s "不过我在线上帮她就够了。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:74
translate chinese ch4_main_755e2699:

    # s "We didn't plan to meet up or anything."
    s "我们没有约着见面什么的。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:75
translate chinese ch4_main_95fc3bb8:

    # mc "Ah, so it's just me and [ch4_name], then..."
    mc "啊，那就只有我和[ch4_name]了……"

# script-ch4.rpyc:76
translate chinese ch4_main_df50d1be:

    # s 1ba "Yep~"
    s 1ba "嗯呐~"

# script-ch4.rpyc:77
translate chinese ch4_main_fab2261a:

    # "There's more silence between us."
    "我们又陷入了沉默。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:79
translate chinese ch4_main_afd64660:

    # "Sayori stares in a random direction."
    "纱世里望着不知什么地方出神。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:80
translate chinese ch4_main_ee146ae9:

    # "Everything about her behavior is really uncharacteristic."
    "她的一举一动，全都透着不像她。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:81
translate chinese ch4_main_ddfa6b61:

    # "I finally get to the point."
    "我终于切入了正题。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:82
translate chinese ch4_main_34fdc6c8:

    # mc "I just...wanted to see how you were doing."
    mc "我只是……想看看你怎么样了。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:83
translate chinese ch4_main_a133cd63:

    # mc "After you left on Friday."
    mc "自从你周五提前走了之后。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:84
translate chinese ch4_main_75a9201e:

    # mc "When something's wrong, you can't hide it from me!"
    mc "不对劲的时候，你可瞒不过我！"

# script-ch4.rpyc:85
translate chinese ch4_main_c9b70b7c:

    # mc "I know you too well."
    mc "我太了解你了。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:86
translate chinese ch4_main_cb70afb1:

    # mc "So..."
    mc "所以……"

# script-ch4.rpyc:87
translate chinese ch4_main_6a9ba0ff:

    # "Sayori smiles, shaking her head."
    "纱世里笑着摇了摇头。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:88
translate chinese ch4_main_55b00119:

    # s 1bd "That's no good, [player]."
    s 1bd "这样不行的，[player]。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:89
translate chinese ch4_main_fb2e5377:

    # mc "Eh?"
    mc "诶？"

# script-ch4.rpyc:90
translate chinese ch4_main_e30500ac:

    # s "Why can't it just be like it's always been?"
    s "为什么不能像从前那样就好呢？"

# script-ch4.rpyc:91
translate chinese ch4_main_628ab9fa:

    # s 1by "This is all my fault."
    s 1by "这都是我的错。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:92
translate chinese ch4_main_1e5e72c5:

    # s "If I didn't get so weak and accidentally express my feelings..."
    s "如果我没有那么软弱，不小心把心事表现了出来……"

# script-ch4.rpyc:93
translate chinese ch4_main_f419234b:

    # s 1bk "If I didn't make that stupid mistake..."
    s 1bk "如果我没犯那个愚蠢的错误……"

# script-ch4.rpyc:94
translate chinese ch4_main_d9944342:

    # s "Then you wouldn't have been worried about me at all."
    s "你根本就不会担心我。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:95
translate chinese ch4_main_c2ee41ba:

    # s "You wouldn't have come here."
    s "也不会到这里来。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:96
translate chinese ch4_main_64624b6c:

    # s 1bd "You wouldn't have even been thinking about me right now."
    s 1bd "此时此刻，你甚至根本不会想起我。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:97
translate chinese ch4_main_05305f6c:

    # s "But this...is just my punishment, isn't it?"
    s "而这一切……只是对我的惩罚，对吧？"

# script-ch4.rpyc:98
translate chinese ch4_main_35b0930c:

    # s "I'm getting punished for being so selfish."
    s "我在为我的自私接受惩罚。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:99
translate chinese ch4_main_34af1de7:

    # s "I think that's why the world decided to have you come over today."
    s "我想，这就是为什么世界安排你今天过来。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:100
translate chinese ch4_main_7db33577:

    # s "It just wants to torture me."
    s "它就是想折磨我而已。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:101
translate chinese ch4_main_51280e41:

    # s 4bq "Ehehe~"
    s 4bq "诶嘿嘿~"

# script-ch4.rpyc:102
translate chinese ch4_main_ce62c226:

    # mc "Sayori!"
    mc "纱世里！"

# script-ch4.rpyc:104
translate chinese ch4_main_b91a73e8:

    # "I grab Sayori by the shoulders."
    "我一把抓住纱世里的肩膀。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:105
translate chinese ch4_main_20fe6359:

    # mc "What on Earth are you saying?!"
    mc "你到底在说什么啊？！"

# script-ch4.rpyc:106
translate chinese ch4_main_cbefa080:

    # mc "Are you listening to yourself right now?"
    mc "你听听你自己的话！"

# script-ch4.rpyc:107
translate chinese ch4_main_8246ee4c:

    # mc "I know something happened to you."
    mc "我知道你出了事。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:108
translate chinese ch4_main_5e1b9bed:

    # mc "There's no other explanation for you to be like this."
    mc "不然你不会变成这样。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:109
translate chinese ch4_main_d778b065:

    # mc "So tell me, already...!"
    mc "所以快告诉我……！"

# script-ch4.rpyc:110
translate chinese ch4_main_5efb74b0:

    # mc "Until I know, I won't be able to stop thinking about it!"
    mc "不知道答案，我是没法安心的！"

# script-ch4.rpyc:111
translate chinese ch4_main_08a841a6:

    # s 4bl "Ah..."
    s 4bl "啊……"

# script-ch4.rpyc:112
translate chinese ch4_main_81d59952:

    # s "Ahaha..."
    s "啊哈……"

# script-ch4.rpyc:113
translate chinese ch4_main_6dbc946c:

    # "Sayori gives me an empty smile."
    "纱世里对我露出一个空洞的笑容。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:114
translate chinese ch4_main_95b305ce:

    # s 4by "You really put me in a trap, [player]."
    s 4by "你真是把我逼到绝路了呢，[player]。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:115
translate chinese ch4_main_c9170687:

    # s "But..."
    s "可是……"

# script-ch4.rpyc:116
translate chinese ch4_main_05d3b914:

    # s 1ba "You're wrong."
    s 1ba "你猜错了。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:117
translate chinese ch4_main_984fcfac:

    # s "Nothing happened to me."
    s "我什么事都没有。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:118
translate chinese ch4_main_3eab9950:

    # s "I've always been like this."
    s "我一直都是这个样子。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:119
translate chinese ch4_main_07fedd4b:

    # s "You're just seeing it for the first time."
    s "只是你第一次看到而已。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:120
translate chinese ch4_main_d540c013:

    # mc "Seeing what?"
    mc "看到什么？"

# script-ch4.rpyc:121
translate chinese ch4_main_5ae14a76:

    # mc "What are you talking about, Sayori?"
    mc "你到底在说什么，纱世里？"

# script-ch4.rpyc:122
translate chinese ch4_main_67281b29:

    # s 1bq "Ehehe~"
    s 1bq "诶嘿嘿~"

# script-ch4.rpyc:123
translate chinese ch4_main_c05b8cdb:

    # s 1ba "You're really just going to make me say it, aren't you, [player]?"
    s 1ba "你是真的非要我亲口说出来不可了，对吧，[player]？"

# script-ch4.rpyc:124
translate chinese ch4_main_58e8d872:

    # s "I guess I have no choice this time."
    s "这次看来是躲不掉了。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:125
translate chinese ch4_main_068d9aad:

    # s 1bc "The thing is..."
    s 1bc "其实是……"

# script-ch4.rpyc:126
translate chinese ch4_main_b9a43929:

    # s "I've had really bad depression my whole life."
    s "我从小时候起，就一直有很严重的抑郁症。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:127
translate chinese ch4_main_54937bac:

    # s 1bb "Did you know that?"
    s 1bb "你知道吗？"

# script-ch4.rpyc:128
translate chinese ch4_main_bc5feba5:

    # s "Why do you think I'm late to school every day?"
    s "你觉得，我为什么每天上学都迟到？"

# script-ch4.rpyc:129
translate chinese ch4_main_968d7c40:

    # s "Because most days, I can't even find a reason to get out of bed."
    s "因为大多数日子里，我连起床的理由都找不到。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:130
translate chinese ch4_main_fd1c4b3e:

    # s 1by "What reason is there to do anything when I fully know how worthless I am?"
    s 1by "明明清楚地知道自己有多没用，做什么还能有什么意义呢？"

# script-ch4.rpyc:131
translate chinese ch4_main_86925814:

    # s "Why go to school?"
    s "为什么要上学？"

# script-ch4.rpyc:132
translate chinese ch4_main_3120cbcb:

    # s "Why eat?"
    s "为什么要吃饭？"

# script-ch4.rpyc:133
translate chinese ch4_main_ce05cc1f:

    # s "Why make friends?"
    s "为什么要交朋友？"

# script-ch4.rpyc:134
translate chinese ch4_main_b8110758:

    # s "Why make other people put their energy and caring to waste by having them spend it on me?"
    s "为什么要让别人把精力和心意，白白浪费在我身上？"

# script-ch4.rpyc:135
translate chinese ch4_main_49b2decf:

    # s "That's what it feels like."
    s "在我心里，就是这种感觉。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:136
translate chinese ch4_main_b903ffad:

    # s "And that's why I just want to make everyone happy..."
    s "所以我才只想着让大家都开心……"

# script-ch4.rpyc:137
translate chinese ch4_main_d624f808:

    # s "Without anyone worrying about me."
    s "而不用任何人来担心我。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:138
translate chinese ch4_main_2b35b6fe:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# script-ch4.rpyc:139
translate chinese ch4_main_42dbe169:

    # "I'm in shock."
    "我彻底怔住了。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:140
translate chinese ch4_main_f9ec361d:

    # "I can't even figure out how to respond."
    "甚至不知道该作何回应。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:141
translate chinese ch4_main_cdec7507:

    # "How is it possible that Sayori kept this from me the entire time that I've known her?"
