    # s "And I was punished by my heart hurting in a way that I couldn't understand."
    s "作为惩罚，我的心开始以一种我无法理解的方式作痛。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:183
translate chinese ch4_main_3874471a:

    # s "And now you came here and I made you hurt, too."
    s "现在你来到这里，我又让你也跟着受伤。"

