    # y "I'm sorry, I'm sorry..."
    y "对不起，对不起……"

# script-ch4.rpyc:915
translate chinese ch4_exclusive_yuri_93deaf69:

    # mc "Ah..."
    mc "啊……"

# script-ch4.rpyc:916
translate chinese ch4_exclusive_yuri_5545b90b:

    # "Sure, it was a little weird, and it took me by surprise..."
    "确实有点奇怪，也着实吓了我一跳……"

# script-ch4.rpyc:917
translate chinese ch4_exclusive_yuri_c4cc71cf:

    # "But I guess she was just trying to help, right...?"
    "不过她应该只是想帮我处理，对吧……？"

# script-ch4.rpyc:918
translate chinese ch4_exclusive_yuri_0b0e5f5b:

    # mc "Yuri, I think you're overreacting a little..."
    mc "优里，你有点反应过度了……"

# script-ch4.rpyc:919
translate chinese ch4_exclusive_yuri_71fa57dd:

    # y "Uuuh..."
    y "呜呜……"

# script-ch4.rpyc:920
translate chinese ch4_exclusive_yuri_73c62ed6:

    # "She doesn't lift her head."
    "她一直没抬头。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:921
translate chinese ch4_exclusive_yuri_93d8fc18:

    # "What if she doesn't recover from this for the rest of the afternoon?"
    "她这副样子，一下午都缓不过来怎么办？"

# script-ch4.rpyc:922
translate chinese ch4_exclusive_yuri_3d3ac541:

    # mc "Alright, you know what..."
    mc "好吧，豁出去了……"

# script-ch4.rpyc:923
translate chinese ch4_exclusive_yuri_1d9a660b:

    # "This might be a stupid thing to do, but I do it anyway."
    "这也许是个蠢主意，但我还是做了。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:924
translate chinese ch4_exclusive_yuri_5795b8d6:

    # "I take Yuri's hand and lick her index finger in return."
    "我拉过优里的手，照样舔了一下她的食指。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:926
translate chinese ch4_exclusive_yuri_70468acb:

    # y "[player]--!!"
    y "[player]——！！"

# script-ch4.rpyc:927
translate chinese ch4_exclusive_yuri_33afe2fb:

    # y "D-Did you really just do that?"
    y "你、你刚才真的那么做了？"

# script-ch4.rpyc:928
translate chinese ch4_exclusive_yuri_b952ccca:

    # mc "N-Now we're even..."
    mc "这、这下扯平了……"

# script-ch4.rpyc:929
translate chinese ch4_exclusive_yuri_52a4ea86:

    # y 3bv "..."
    y 3bv "……"

# script-ch4.rpyc:930
translate chinese ch4_exclusive_yuri_f474f2b9:

    # "Yuri just looks at me like I did something wrong."
    "优里就那么看着我，像是我做错了什么似的。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:931
translate chinese ch4_exclusive_yuri_7a59b594_1:

    # mc "Ahaha..."
    mc "哈哈……"

# script-ch4.rpyc:932
translate chinese ch4_exclusive_yuri_c61d5d45:

    # mc "I knew that would be a bad idea..."
    mc "我就知道这主意不妙……"

# script-ch4.rpyc:933
translate chinese ch4_exclusive_yuri_8e154315:

    # "If not for the sweet aroma of the Jasmine oil, the air would be extremely heavy right now."
    "要不是茉莉精油的甜香，此刻的空气恐怕已经凝固了。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:934
translate chinese ch4_exclusive_yuri_93afc4bd:

    # y 1bu "You're so weird, [player]."
    y 1bu "你真是个怪人，[player]。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:935
translate chinese ch4_exclusive_yuri_d1f86faa:

    # "Yuri giggles shyly."
    "优里害羞地轻笑。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:936
translate chinese ch4_exclusive_yuri_bbe4458e_1:

    # mc "Eh...?"
    mc "诶……？"

# script-ch4.rpyc:937
translate chinese ch4_exclusive_yuri_b21a4ab2:

    # "Yuri calling {i}me{/i} weird?"
    "优里居然说{i}我{/i}是怪人？"

# script-ch4.rpyc:938
translate chinese ch4_exclusive_yuri_4509d67c:

    # "I have no response to that..."
    "我竟无言以对……"

# script-ch4.rpyc:939
translate chinese ch4_exclusive_yuri_f26759eb:

    # y 1bf "Where do you keep your bandages?"
    y 1bf "你的创可贴放在哪儿？"

# script-ch4.rpyc:940
translate chinese ch4_exclusive_yuri_93deaf69_1:

    # mc "Ah..."
    mc "啊……"

# script-ch4.rpyc:941
translate chinese ch4_exclusive_yuri_1d482e7a:

    # mc "I don't think I need one, actually."
    mc "其实应该用不着。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:942
translate chinese ch4_exclusive_yuri_a13e7605:

    # mc "It was a tiny cut."
    mc "就划了道小口子。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:943
translate chinese ch4_exclusive_yuri_84cbbbab:

    # mc "Look, it already stopped bleeding."
    mc "你看，血已经止住了。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:944
translate chinese ch4_exclusive_yuri_02335ffd:

    # y 1ba "I see..."
    y 1ba "那就好……"

# script-ch4.rpyc:945
translate chinese ch4_exclusive_yuri_e88d809b:

    # y "That's relieving."
    y "太让人安心了。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:946
translate chinese ch4_exclusive_yuri_d6c968ec:

    # "The tension is quickly lifted."
    "紧张的气氛很快烟消云散。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:947
translate chinese ch4_exclusive_yuri_8318b800:

    # "We each resume our respective activities."
    "我们重新回到各自的工作中。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:948
translate chinese ch4_exclusive_yuri_7b1ea838:

    # "I watch Yuri's knife cut through the ribbon like it's nothing but air."
    "我看着优里的刀切过缎带，如穿过空气般干脆。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:949
translate chinese ch4_exclusive_yuri_9915cc08:

    # "Meanwhile, I continue to make progress on the paper."
    "另一边，我的写字工程也在稳步推进。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:952
translate chinese ch4_exclusive_yuri_5468995c:

    # "After we finish attaching the paper to the ribbons, we lay them all out side by side."
    "把纸全部系上缎带后，我们把它们一字排开。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:953
translate chinese ch4_exclusive_yuri_f65e23a4:

    # "It looks better than I expected and will be very effective as a door curtain."
    "效果比预想的还好，做成门帘一定非常出彩。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:954
translate chinese ch4_exclusive_yuri_135a7724:

    # mc "It looks great."
    mc "太好看了。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:955
translate chinese ch4_exclusive_yuri_6fd41911:

    # mc "Good thinking coming up with this, Yuri."
    mc "亏你想得出来，优里。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:957
translate chinese ch4_exclusive_yuri_672fb4b2:

    # y "Ah, thanks..."
    y "啊，谢谢……"

# script-ch4.rpyc:958
translate chinese ch4_exclusive_yuri_586312e0:

    # y "It's just something I saw online, really."
    y "其实只是网上看到过的点子。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:959
translate chinese ch4_exclusive_yuri_cebe4068:

    # y 1ba "Are you ready to move onto the next task?"
    y 1ba "准备进行下一项了吗？"

# script-ch4.rpyc:960
translate chinese ch4_exclusive_yuri_39ef9b02:

    # mc "Yeah, let's do it."
    mc "嗯，来吧。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:961
translate chinese ch4_exclusive_yuri_068582fd:

    # mc "What do you have in mind?"
    mc "接下来做什么？"

# script-ch4.rpyc:962
translate chinese ch4_exclusive_yuri_6fb26d3d:

    # y "I'd like to create a banner."
    y "我想做一条横幅。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:963
translate chinese ch4_exclusive_yuri_dfef5d98:

    # y "That's why I asked you to buy the paint tablets."
    y "所以之前才让你买了固体水彩。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:964
translate chinese ch4_exclusive_yuri_96a57d25:

    # mc "Ah, that's right."
    mc "啊，对哦。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:965
translate chinese ch4_exclusive_yuri_4d3528f0:

    # "One of the items Yuri had asked me to buy was a kit of watercolor paint tablets."
    "优里让我买的东西里，有一盒固体水彩颜料。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:966
translate chinese ch4_exclusive_yuri_623899fe:

    # y 1bf "We'll need about six cups of water to put each of the tablets in."
    y 1bf "需要大约六杯水，把颜料一块块泡开。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:967
translate chinese ch4_exclusive_yuri_823c4f64:

    # y "Do you mind fetching those for us?"
    y "能麻烦你去端一下吗？"

# script-ch4.rpyc:968
translate chinese ch4_exclusive_yuri_c2eb53da:

    # mc "Of course not."
    mc "当然可以。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:969
translate chinese ch4_exclusive_yuri_3da16ede:

    # mc "Six cups of water..."
    mc "六杯水……"

# script-ch4.rpyc:970
translate chinese ch4_exclusive_yuri_bead7f72:

    # mc "I'll be right back in a minute."
    mc "马上去去就回。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:971
translate chinese ch4_exclusive_yuri_b5bd7011:

    # y 1ba "Thank you very much."
    y 1ba "麻烦你了。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:972
translate chinese ch4_exclusive_yuri_1f653764:

    # y 2bf "Oh, and just a little bit of water is okay."
    y 2bf "啊，水放一点点就好。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:973
translate chinese ch4_exclusive_yuri_50bc645c:

    # y "If you fill the cups too much, it will be too diluted."
    y "杯子太满的话，颜色就淡了。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:976
translate chinese ch4_exclusive_yuri_b093d7f5:

    # "Taking Yuri's advice, I decide to use small plastic bathroom cups rather than full-sized glasses."
    "听从优里的建议，我拿了几个漱口用的小塑料杯，没用大玻璃杯。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:977
translate chinese ch4_exclusive_yuri_b961b16f:

    # "I put them on a plate to catch any paint that drips, then bring it back into my room."
    "我把杯子放在盘子上接住滴落的颜料，端回房间。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:978
translate chinese ch4_exclusive_yuri_a09b77d5:

    # mc "Yuri?"
    mc "优里？"

# script-ch4.rpyc:980
translate chinese ch4_exclusive_yuri_b83ad773:

    # y "Yes?"
    y "怎么了？"

# script-ch4.rpyc:981
translate chinese ch4_exclusive_yuri_efc7b6df:

    # "I come in to see Yuri quickly unrolling her sleeve, pulling it back over her arm."
    "我走进房间，正撞见优里慌忙放下卷起的衣袖，把手臂重新遮住。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:982
translate chinese ch4_exclusive_yuri_ef5f85f4:

    # mc "Ah, nothing..."
    mc "啊，没什么……"

# script-ch4.rpyc:983
translate chinese ch4_exclusive_yuri_9fa41e43:

    # mc "Your face is a little red."
    mc "你脸有点红。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:984
translate chinese ch4_exclusive_yuri_675d7d5c:

    # mc "Is it too hot in here, or anything?"
    mc "屋里太热了吗？"

# script-ch4.rpyc:985
translate chinese ch4_exclusive_yuri_2d1d7d7e:

    # y 3bq "Ah--"
    y 3bq "啊——"

# script-ch4.rpyc:986
translate chinese ch4_exclusive_yuri_7a464969:

    # y "No, not at all!"
    y "不，完全没有！"

# script-ch4.rpyc:987
translate chinese ch4_exclusive_yuri_a16ccc28:

    # y "There's nothing wrong, so..."
    y "什么事都没有，所以……"

# script-ch4.rpyc:988
translate chinese ch4_exclusive_yuri_db4340a5:

    # y "Let's mix the paint."
    y "来调颜料吧。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:989
translate chinese ch4_exclusive_yuri_b0290512:

    # "Yuri hurriedly dismisses me and takes it upon herself to unwrap the tablets, dropping them into the cups."
    "优里急匆匆地岔开话题，自顾自动手拆开颜料，一颗颗放进杯子里。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:990
translate chinese ch4_exclusive_yuri_3e4bce89:

    # y 1ba "So..."
    y 1ba "那么……"

# script-ch4.rpyc:991
translate chinese ch4_exclusive_yuri_b644a548:

    # y "I thought we would do something simple that would look very nice."
    y "我想做点简单又好看的东西。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:992
translate chinese ch4_exclusive_yuri_6b6d95e8:

    # y "I'd like to paint a gradient across the banner..."
    y "我想在横幅上画一道渐变……"

# script-ch4.rpyc:993
translate chinese ch4_exclusive_yuri_3f3a93a3:

    # y "Starting with the colors for a sunrise, then daytime, then sunset and nighttime."
    y "从日出的颜色开始，接白天、日落，最后是夜晚。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:994
translate chinese ch4_exclusive_yuri_7b6ef5bc:

    # y "Once it dries, I'll write an inspirational quote across the banner."
    y "等颜料干透，我会在横幅上写一句励志的话。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:995
translate chinese ch4_exclusive_yuri_c969de9e:

    # y "We can hang it on the wall behind the podium at the front of the classroom."
    y "到时候挂在教室前方、讲台后面的墙上。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:996
translate chinese ch4_exclusive_yuri_0e82c4ee:

    # mc "Ah, neat."
    mc "啊，不错。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:997
translate chinese ch4_exclusive_yuri_e7727079:

    # mc "What are you going to write?"
    mc "打算写什么？"

# script-ch4.rpyc:998
translate chinese ch4_exclusive_yuri_052e996f:

    # y 2bm "Well..."
    y 2bm "这个嘛……"

# script-ch4.rpyc:999
translate chinese ch4_exclusive_yuri_d95e4e0a:

    # y "...It will be more fun to surprise you."
    y "……到时候给你个惊喜，不是更有趣吗。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:1000
translate chinese ch4_exclusive_yuri_35fbb699:

    # "Yuri smiles at me."
    "优里对我微微一笑。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:1001
translate chinese ch4_exclusive_yuri_0f240219:

    # mc "If you say so..."
    mc "好吧，随你……"

# script-ch4.rpyc:1004
translate chinese ch4_exclusive_yuri_197498ac:

    # "After rolling out the banner, Yuri and I kneel on opposite sides so we don't get in the way of each other."
    "铺开横幅后，我和优里跪坐在两侧，免得互相碍事。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:1005
translate chinese ch4_exclusive_yuri_bd5f479c:

    # "Yuri uses a brush and adds a few dots of different colors across the banner to serve as a color guide when we paint."
    "优里用画笔在横幅各处点上不同颜色的圆点，作为上色时的参照。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:1006
translate chinese ch4_exclusive_yuri_16905ab4:

    # mc "This kind of reminds me of elementary school..."
    mc "这感觉有点像小学的时候……"

# script-ch4.rpyc:1007
translate chinese ch4_exclusive_yuri_43b22982:

    # "Painting on a banner with watercolors feels a lot like the art class projects we had back then."
    "用水彩画横幅，跟当年美术课上的手工活简直一模一样。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:1008
translate chinese ch4_exclusive_yuri_a8b0e464:

    # "It's relaxing."
    "让人心里很松弛。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:1010
translate chinese ch4_exclusive_yuri_728dcbc5_1:

    # y "Ah..."
    y "啊……"

# script-ch4.rpyc:1011
translate chinese ch4_exclusive_yuri_56217eb5:

    # y "I'm sorry if this feels too childish...!"
    y "抱歉，是不是太孩子气了……！"

# script-ch4.rpyc:1012
translate chinese ch4_exclusive_yuri_be62e824:

    # mc "No, I didn't mean that at all."
    mc "不，我完全不是那个意思。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:1013
translate chinese ch4_exclusive_yuri_636d9380:

    # mc "It's kind of fun, you know?"
    mc "其实挺有意思的。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:1014
translate chinese ch4_exclusive_yuri_e9a8b6f3:

    # y 1bs "...Yeah."
    y 1bs "……嗯。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:1015
translate chinese ch4_exclusive_yuri_a022de23:

    # y "It is fun."
    y "很有意思。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:1016
translate chinese ch4_exclusive_yuri_1dd76b95:

    # y "I'm glad you feel that way, too."
    y "你也这么觉得，太好了。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:1017
translate chinese ch4_exclusive_yuri_d4ca8264:

    # "Yuri stops painting for a moment, thinking to herself."
    "优里停下画笔，出了会儿神。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:1018
translate chinese ch4_exclusive_yuri_c2c620fb:

    # y 2bl "For me..."
    y 2bl "对我来说……"

# script-ch4.rpyc:1019
translate chinese ch4_exclusive_yuri_76d4ffa1:

    # y "I don't need to go out and do crazy things to have fun."
    y "开心不需要出去做什么惊天动地的事。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:1020
translate chinese ch4_exclusive_yuri_33388526:

    # y "In fact, I usually don't even want to."
    y "说实话，我平时连那个念头都没有。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:1021
translate chinese ch4_exclusive_yuri_128efca8:

    # y 2bf "I just like when I can spend time with one other person..."
    y "我只喜欢和另一个人安静地待在一起……"

# script-ch4.rpyc:1022
translate chinese ch4_exclusive_yuri_005b197c:

    # y "Even if it's something simple, like reading - it doesn't even matter if we don't talk much."
    y "哪怕只是读书这样简单的事——甚至不怎么说话都没关系。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:1023
translate chinese ch4_exclusive_yuri_4ed83b82:

    # y 2ba "Just having a friend next to me makes things feel a little bit nicer."
    y "只要有朋友在身旁，一切就都会美好一点。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:1024
translate chinese ch4_exclusive_yuri_c3bb862b:

    # y "I think that's all it takes for me to be happy."
    y "我想，这就是我需要的全部幸福。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:1025
translate chinese ch4_exclusive_yuri_85d4ab1c:

    # mc "Is that so...?"
    mc "这样啊……？"

# script-ch4.rpyc:1026
translate chinese ch4_exclusive_yuri_b2a4a3d5:

    # "Even if Yuri and I are quite different, I can understand where she's coming from."
    "虽然我和优里性格迥异，但她的心情我能懂。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:1027
translate chinese ch4_exclusive_yuri_750d2661:

    # "I feel that way about things like anime and games, where simply sharing the experience with someone can make me happy."
    "就像我对动画和游戏那样——仅仅是与人分享，就足以让我开心。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:1028
translate chinese ch4_exclusive_yuri_d0c830b0:

    # mc "I think I feel the same way."
    mc "我想我也是一样。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:1029
translate chinese ch4_exclusive_yuri_f1c99cd9:

    # "Yuri smiles gently."
    "优里温柔地笑了。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:1030
translate chinese ch4_exclusive_yuri_7bceb5ec:

    # y 1bm "I knew you'd understand..."
    y 1bm "我就知道你会懂……"

# script-ch4.rpyc:1031
translate chinese ch4_exclusive_yuri_af179c74:

    # "Yuri leans over the banner to grab an unused paintbrush."
    "优里俯身去够一支没用过的画笔。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:1032
translate chinese ch4_exclusive_yuri_4a901502:

    # "But I move at the same time, causing my head to bump into hers."
    "偏偏我也动了，脑袋结结实实撞上她的。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:1033
translate chinese ch4_exclusive_yuri_742c38fe:

    # y 3bn "Kya--!"
    y 3bn "呀——！"

# script-ch4.rpyc:1034
translate chinese ch4_exclusive_yuri_c817a551:

    # mc "S-Sorry!"
    mc "对、对不起！"

# script-ch4.rpyc:1035
translate chinese ch4_exclusive_yuri_b5ff971c:

    # "Yuri reels back, and I quickly lift my hands in surprise."
    "优里猛地向后一缩，我慌忙举起双手。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:1036
translate chinese ch4_exclusive_yuri_a80d2f8a:

    # mc "Are you hurt?"
    mc "撞疼了吗？"

# script-ch4.rpyc:1037
translate chinese ch4_exclusive_yuri_fb0e853e:

    # y 2bv "N-No, I'm not hurt."
    y 2bv "没、没有，不疼。"

# script-ch4.rpyc:1038
translate chinese ch4_exclusive_yuri_5aa191a8:

